CR_fighting_pipeline — live observation, inference and Android touch bridge.

This release includes original bridge software and a deployment-only subset of
FirstLight CR, both under Apache-2.0. The upstream project and its model weights
have not been modified. See LICENSE, probe/FIRSTLIGHT_NOTICE.md and
probe/UPSTREAM_NOTICE for upstream attribution and material boundaries.

Release packaging modifies local configuration, launchers and probe installation;
the default native probe is the previously validated stable build. Experimental
source is retained for reproducibility but is not the default runtime profile.

No APK, original game/SDK library, training replay or game resource is
redistributed here. The five FirstLight model weights under weights/ are
redistributed unchanged; their upstream hashes are recorded in upstream.lock.json.
The original SDK required by the proxy is preserved from the user's own
installation on that user's device. Product names identify compatibility; this
project is not affiliated with Supercell, Null's or MuMu.
